<P></P>
<P align=center>&nbsp;</P>
<P align=center>Also, MAPS! Though the game doesn`t come with all the places mapped out, you can&nbsp;<A href="http://eqtoolbox.not.net/">Download Them</A>&nbsp;and never be lost again.. maybe.<BR><IMG alt=Maps!!! hspace=0 src="http://coven.guildwizard.com/pics///////Updates///////MapWindow.JPG" align=baseline border=0><BR></P>
